  note right of CommunityStateFold
    Total order = topological over parents,
    ties broken by lower digest. Every operation is
    re-authorized against its causal past when applied;
    one that was not allowed then is skipped, and so is
    one past the author quota (the founder has none).
    The last member leaving is the tombstone.
    A concurrent whole value (profile, member roles,
    channel visibility, role) is rebased from the state
    of its parents onto the state it applies to.
  end note

